docs {
  Full-replace write of the Achievements & Extracurricular Profile screen
  — internships, work experience, languages, awards (academic/sports/
  arts & cultural), hobbies & interests, publications, patents,
  professional certifications, portfolio links, recommendation letters,
  innovation & entrepreneurship, and volunteering, all in one submission.

  Every field/section is optional — this whole screen is supplementary,
  unlike personal/family/address/qualification. Not part of the
  submit-gating pendingAction chain, so leaving it empty never blocks
  submission. Lands on the Student profile
  (`Student.achievementsDetails`), reusable across applications, frozen
  onto the Application row at Submit — same pattern as the other detail
  steps. Advances currentStep to at least 7.
}
